{"unit_id":"StruggleYang__dsh-project-kanban#card-zh","repo":"StruggleYang/dsh-project-kanban","commit":"2d485eb697fa2914d7d98e7c5dadc4210bbc6aef","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-project-kanban 为 DSH 网页会话加入项目看板，并提供 agent 工具。看板按工作区隔离并保存到宿主文件服务。用户可管理卡片和列表、调整优先级与截止日期、搜索筛选并批量操作，适合在 DSH 会话中进行团队项目规划与任务跟踪。需要 DSH web profile，无需 API 密钥。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:18-28","index.js:51-95","index.js:440-475","lib/client.js:372-384"]}
{"unit_id":"StruggleYang__dsh-project-kanban#card-en","repo":"StruggleYang/dsh-project-kanban","commit":"2d485eb697fa2914d7d98e7c5dadc4210bbc6aef","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-project-kanban adds a kanban panel and agent tools to DSH web sessions. Boards are isolated by workspace and saved through the host filesystem service. Users manage tasks, due dates, columns, and filters. It supports project planning and requires a web profile; no API key is needed.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:18-28","index.js:51-95","index.js:440-475","lib/client.js:372-384"]}
