{"unit_id":"StruggleYang__dsh-project-kanban#feature-1","repo":"StruggleYang/dsh-project-kanban","commit":"2d485eb697fa2914d7d98e7c5dadc4210bbc6aef","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-project-kanban 的功能「Agent 卡片」：agent 可读取、创建和更新任务卡片。使用 kanban_get、kanban_add_card 或 kanban_update_card。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:461-546"]}
{"unit_id":"StruggleYang__dsh-project-kanban#feature-2","repo":"StruggleYang/dsh-project-kanban","commit":"2d485eb697fa2914d7d98e7c5dadc4210bbc6aef","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-project-kanban 的功能「工作区看板」：根据会话工作目录解析工作区，为不同项目维护独立的列和卡片。agent 调用看板工具时自动选择当前工作区，未能解析时使用默认工作区。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:97-112","index.js:51-83"]}
{"unit_id":"StruggleYang__dsh-project-kanban#feature-3","repo":"StruggleYang/dsh-project-kanban","commit":"2d485eb697fa2914d7d98e7c5dadc4210bbc6aef","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-project-kanban 的功能「看板持久化」：通过宿主文件服务读取和保存工作区看板 JSON 文件；文件不可用时保留内存中的看板数据。用户在看板或 agent 工具中修改后写回文件。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:32-49","index.js:51-95"]}
{"unit_id":"StruggleYang__dsh-project-kanban#feature-4","repo":"StruggleYang/dsh-project-kanban","commit":"2d485eb697fa2914d7d98e7c5dadc4210bbc6aef","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-project-kanban 的功能「网页看板操作」：在 DSH 会话视图中展示看板，可创建列和卡片、编辑卡片、按列移动及拖动排序，并按关键词、标签或优先级筛选。操作由同源 /api/kanban 路由处理。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:93-121","lib/client.js:292-384","index.js:375-400"]}
{"unit_id":"StruggleYang__dsh-project-kanban#feature-5","repo":"StruggleYang/dsh-project-kanban","commit":"2d485eb697fa2914d7d98e7c5dadc4210bbc6aef","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-project-kanban 的功能「回收站与批量管理」：看板支持归档卡片、恢复或彻底删除，并提供批量移动和批量归档工具。用户可在网页面板查看归档项并执行管理操作。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:550-565","index.js:633-692","lib/client.js:292-368"]}
